{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_f_01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_f_01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "F80DCD9BF3F4D6BC",
      "text": "Bonjour à tous. Je me nomme Hassa, et je serai\\nvotre enseignant dans ce cours sur les beaux-arts.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "F80DD09BF3F4DBD5",
      "text": "Mais avant toute chose...\\nÊtes-vous capable de définir ce qui est beau ?\\r\\nPouvez-vous me décrire ce qu’est l’art ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "F80DCF9BF3F4DA22",
      "text": "J’imagine qu’une fois diplômés de l’académie,\\nla plupart d’entre vous ne sauront toujours pas\\r\\nrépondre à ces questions...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "F80DCA9BF3F4D1A3",
      "text": "Après tout, la suite de votre parcours estudiantin\\nou vos futures recherches d’emploi ne requerront\\r\\npas de connaissances ou de sensibilité artistiques.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "F80DC99BF3F4CFF0",
      "text": "Nous pourrions ainsi en conclure que mon cours\\nest tout à fait inutile, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "F80DCC9BF3F4D509",
      "text": "Penser cela serait une erreur. Tout du moins,\\nje veux continuer de le croire.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "F80DCB9BF3F4D356",
      "text": "Je vous invite à vous poser la question suivante :\\nd’où vient la différence entre le beau et le laid ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1A79702FE1688C5D",
      "text": "Cela dépend des formes et des couleurs.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1A796D2FE1688744",
      "text": "C’est une question de goût.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1A796E2FE16888F7",
      "text": "Je ne sais pas.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "8535359B48B5456D",
      "text": "Oui, je vois... Merci d’avoir partagé votre avis,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "F80DD69BF3F4E607",
      "text": "Bien entendu, il n’existe pas de bonne ou de\\nmauvaise réponse à cette question.\\c\\nL’important n’est pas tant de trouver une\\nréponse, mais plutôt de réfléchir à la question.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "F80DD59BF3F4E454",
      "text": "Prenons un exemple. Disons que vous vous\\npromenez le long d’un chemin bordé de fleurs.\\c\\nPourquoi donc avez-vous la sensation que\\nces fleurs sont « belles » ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "F80A489BF3F1BEE6",
      "text": "Savourer les différences entre le bleu du ciel\\net celui de la mer, s’interroger sur la parure\\r\\ndes arbres au fil des saisons, se laisser bercer\\r\\npar le mouvement du moulin de Cuencia,\\r\\nou charmer par les eaux glacées de Jarramanca...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 187,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 239,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "F80A499BF3F1C099",
      "text": "Si vous prenez le temps d’observer ainsi ce qui\\nse présente à vous, je suis persuadé que vous\\r\\nserez touchés plus profondément et durablement\\r\\npar tous les détails de votre vie.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_12",
      "hash64": "F80A469BF3F1BB80",
      "text": "Ainsi, lorsque vous êtes harassés par vos\\nrévisions ou par votre travail...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_13",
      "hash64": "F80A479BF3F1BD33",
      "text": "Peut-être que c’est la beauté de ce monde qui\\nvous donnera la force d’avancer.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_14",
      "hash64": "F80A4C9BF3F1C5B2",
      "text": "Ne vous tracassez pas si ces concepts vous\\nsemblent compliqués pour l’instant.\\c\\nVous aurez tout le loisir d’en faire l’expérience\\npar vous-mêmes... Mais laissez-moi résumer.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 175,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "F80A4D9BF3F1C765",
      "text": "Finalement, nous pouvons considérer l’art comme\\ntout ce que l’on trouve beau.\\c\\nIl ne nous est pas indispensable, mais il est\\ncapable d’illuminer nos existences ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "F80A4A9BF3F1C24C",
      "text": "Ainsi, si mon cours permet de mettre un peu de\\ncouleur dans vos vies, j’en serai très heureux.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "F80A4B9BF3F1C3FF",
      "text": "Ce sera tout pour aujourd’hui.\\c\\nLors de notre prochain cours, j’essaierai de vous\\nconfronter concrètement à ce qui est beau.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
